      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只不過，有個問題……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA4E0D904EFF0C6709500B554F984C2026202600100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這香味會過度刺激食慾。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019999954736703904E5EA6523A6FC098DF617E300200100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對某些人也許有用途，\n但這要作為商品銷售就很難了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D67D04E9B4EBA4E5F8A31670975289014FF0C000A4F46901989814F5C70BA554654C192B7552E5C315F8896E34E86300200100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過，我還是調出了很厲害的香水。\n所以……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
